"use": "邸宅 (a high-security estate, a tycoon's or an 組長's): a 64 x 50 m walled lot -- a 3 m wall with a tiled cap and cameras, the pedestrian gate (a locked EXIT_ in _Open) and the vehicle gate under a barrier, both watched from the 詰所 guard post; the 32 x 16 m two-storey main house on a raised floor behind a porte-cochère: the grand genkan, the guards' room, 待合, the 警備室 (monitors), the 応接間, the tatami 大広間 with 床の間 and 神棚, bath and WC, the kitchen-dining and a back door; upstairs the study (safe, gun locker: MARK_weapon), the PANIC ROOM (0.45 m steel walls), bedrooms, a bath; a three-car garage (MARK_vehicle); a garden with a pond; wall-patrol spawns. probe_xz is under the porte-cochère. kits/interiors/SecureMansion.blend (the artist's; a PLACEHOLDER shell and fit-out, ARTIST_NOTES.md lists what to replace)",
"wall_top_m": 3.25
}

